WEBVTT

00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:03.310
All right, here I come!

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.840
'Kay!

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.860
Okay, now it's your turn, Hotarun!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.280
But...

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:20.240
Isn't this kind of high up?

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:22.610
It's fine, it's fine!

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:24.320
You're over water!

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.950
We've got a life preserver on a rope here.

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.430
C'mon, even Nee-chan can do it.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.550
What do you mean, "even" me?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.440
<b>Episode 7</b>

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.440
<b>We Bravely Dove In</b>

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:18.190
My clothes are soaked.

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:20.110
Better get dried off before the bus comes.

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:24.240
Um, sorry I couldn't manage to jump in.

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.370
It's not your fault. If you're 
scared, you're scared.

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.230
I guess being used to it helps.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:33.470
Nee-chan's fine with the river, 
but she's scared of the ocean.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:36.010
Well, there might be weird 
creatures living there!

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:38.200
So it's your first time 
doing stuff like this?

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:41.540
Yes. My first experience 
with diving in a river,

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:44.580
and my first time at a secret 
base like this, too.

00:02:44.900 --> 00:02:49.190
Yeah, we used to use this all the 
time, but I totally forgot about it.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:51.770
We finally came back to 
it, and it was a mess.

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:54.130
It's beautiful now.

00:02:54.130 --> 00:02:56.440
Hotaru and I cleaned it up.

00:02:56.930 --> 00:02:59.110
I brought some stuff from home, too.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:02.250
We've got another secret 
base besides this one.

00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:03.490
You do?

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.700
Oh, yeah, the one near our house.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.960
Hey, why don't we head back to the bus stop?

00:03:08.960 --> 00:03:10.810
We don't want to miss it.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:12.420
Yeah, I guess we should.

00:03:12.420 --> 00:03:14.760
We can dry off as we walk.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:30.420
What are you all doing after lunch today?

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:34.460
We're going to our grandma's after lunch.

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:36.110
We can play tomorrow afternoon, though.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.220
Can you play, Hotarun?

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:39.860
Sure, I'm free.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.260
Okay, we'll see you at the secret 
base again tomorrow afternoon.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.220
Got it!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:06.950
Oh, Ren-chan, I'll head to 
your house after lunch, okay?

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:07.810
'Kay!

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:11.850
I'm home!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.700
Welcome back.

00:04:13.700 --> 00:04:16.100
Hotaru-chan, a letter came for you.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.110
A letter?

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.670
Looks like it's from your friend in Tokyo.

00:04:23.270 --> 00:04:26.780
Wow! She sent me a letter!

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:37.480
So? Are they all doing well?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.910
Yeah. She says they're fine.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.760
And that they all went to an amusement park.

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.510
Oh? Which one?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.590
The one we went to last summer.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.420
Make sure you write back to her.

00:04:49.420 --> 00:04:50.490
I will.

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.770
Amusement park, huh?

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.520
They look like they had a lot of fun.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.590
Are you going out to play 
again after you eat?

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:10.120
Hotarun is coming over after lunch.

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.430
Okay.

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:15.500
Oh, would you put some rice on the altar?

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.190
I need to take care of the laundry.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.080
'Kay.

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.840
What are you doing, Hika-nee?

00:05:53.840 --> 00:05:58.660
Can't you tell? I'm using the massage chair.

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:02.270
All the hustle and bustle 
of the city wears me out.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.460
So now that I'm home for a visit,

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.010
I thought I'd work out the stiffness.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.220
Oh. I guess.

00:06:11.180 --> 00:06:15.150
Also, there's something 
I wanted to show you.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.770
What? A present?

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:20.440
Huh? Did you forget?

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.940
You know.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:25.090
The thing I said I'd show 
you when I went to Tokyo.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:29.200
Pictures of Tokyo Tower.

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:30.310
Huh?

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.960
Pictures of Tokyo Tower...

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.830
Pictures of Tokyo Tower?!

00:06:35.060 --> 00:06:37.580
I wanna see Tokyo Tower!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.740
Where? Where are the pictures?

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:42.330
Now, don't be in such a hurry.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.180
Amazing! It's Tokyo Tower!

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.580
What do you think?

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.880
I took them on my cell 
phone and had them printed.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:57.470
Nice night scenery too, right?

00:06:57.470 --> 00:06:59.520
Yeah! It's pretty!

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.210
Of course it is.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:03.460
They call it the million-dollar 
view, after all.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:06.270
It's all lit up, even at night.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:08.070
What do people do in these buildings?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.530
I dunno. Work, I guess?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.810
I know what that is! It's called overtime!

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:17.120
So this is the million-dollar overtime!

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.480
Hey, don't crush people's dreams.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:22.130
Is the girl in the picture your friend?

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.250
Yep.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.100
That's good.

00:07:25.100 --> 00:07:28.270
I was worried about whether 
you'd make friends.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.470
I don't need your concern.

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:30.800
Oh, yeah!

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:34.100
Hika-nee, let's go out 
and take some pictures!

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:36.560
I've been into photography lately.

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:38.930
What? I don't wanna do that.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:42.900
There's nothing here to 
take pictures of, anyway.

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.940
You're hopeless, Hika-nee.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.710
Okay, fine.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:53.330
Play dolls with me.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:56.100
No way. I'm not playing with dolls.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.530
Don't worry. It's just to kill a little time.

00:08:05.640 --> 00:08:08.280
Does she really want to play with dolls?

00:08:11.780 --> 00:08:15.090
Hika-nee, I got the dolls.

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.060
This is the mom.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.650
Whoa! Mama's a Chogokin!

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:21.270
And...

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.600
This is the cute little baby.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.600
Ugh, creepy!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.120
And it's huge!

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:29.020
Why is it bigger than the 
mother? Switch them around.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:30.420
I can't.

00:08:30.420 --> 00:08:33.030
There's no changing what's 
already been decided.

00:08:34.270 --> 00:08:36.540
Okay, you're the baby.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:40.110
What? Why do I have to be the baby?

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:41.370
I said I'm not playing.

00:08:41.610 --> 00:08:43.500
Just do it, Hika-nee!

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:44.670
Uh...

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:54.930
Mom, I don't wanna study for exams anymore.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:05.520
Hika-nee, I told you that's a baby!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.610
Why is it talking so much?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.700
Take this seriously and say "goo-goo!"

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.370
Say "goo-goo" seriously?

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:13.900
What are you even talking about, Renge?

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:17.030
Hika-nee, you have to say "goo-goo!"

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.950
Hika-nee, say "goo-goo!"

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.010
G-Goo-goo.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:43.120
What's the matter, baby? 
You're hungry, aren't you?

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.850
G-Goo-goo.

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:51.250
I don't have a bottle. I'll go find one.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:53.360
We have to keep doing this?

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:56.700
Hika-nee, you can't talk. Say "goo-goo."

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.640
You're so particular about 
the weirdest things.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:01.530
Okay, fine. Goo-goo.

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.850
Okay, I'll go get a bottle.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:05.370
Okay, goo-goo.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.860
She's taking forever, goo-goo.

00:10:18.710 --> 00:10:20.970
Isn't Renge back yet, goo-goo?

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.470
Can we quit now, goo-goo?

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:27.730
I want my milk! Milk, goo-goo...

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:28.930
Goo...

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:52.250
Hotarun, thanks for coming.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.890
Come on in.

00:10:53.890 --> 00:10:56.230
Okay. Thanks for having me.

00:10:56.230 --> 00:10:58.030
I'll get some tea.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.050
Thank you.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:05.600
Are these...

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:07.560
...pictures of Tokyo Tower?

00:11:07.560 --> 00:11:09.700
Hika-nee took those.

00:11:09.700 --> 00:11:11.840
Really? Can I look?

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.020
Go ahead.

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:20.000
Wow...

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:25.240
You know, my friends in Tokyo 
just sent me a picture, too.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:26.950
From their trip to an amusement park.

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:29.000
What?! An amusement park?!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:32.200
I wanna see the picture!
The amusement park!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.960
Sure. I'll bring it tomorrow, okay?

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:38.000
Okay, today we'll play dolls.

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.050
Hika-nee! Hika-nee!

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:44.210
I need you to be the baby again!

00:11:47.610 --> 00:11:50.940
Mom, I'm going out to play with Ren-chan!

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:53.360
Okay! Have a good time!

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:02.180
Hotarun! Morning!

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:04.320
Morning, Ren-chan.

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.580
Hikage-san, you came along, too?

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.770
Renge made me come.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:12.040
Hika-nee stays at home all the 
time, so I dragged her out.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.550
Wow, this hasn't changed, either.

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.100
Hikage-san, you knew about this place?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:39.760
Well, I made this base with 
Candy Store ages ago.

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.070
Really? I had no idea!

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:48.780
It's been cleaned up pretty nice.

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.310
First I wanna see the picture 
of the amusement park in Tokyo.

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.500
Oh, sure.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:56.940
Yeah, Tokyo's amusement 
parks are great, huh?

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:58.080
I get ya.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:00.090
Huh? My bag's gone!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:02.380
I was sure I left the house with it...

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.670
Did you leave it on the bus?

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:07.750
I might have! What do I do?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:09.470
Hika-nee, what should we do?

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:13.250
Do? Well... Go to the bus depot to get it?

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.190
Where's the bus depot?

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:18.080
Uh, it's way up the road from here.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.020
It's pretty far.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.180
Then let's go get it!

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:21.880
Yeah!

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.360
I'll go with you!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:28.230
But Komari-senpai and Natsumi-senpai 
said they'd meet us here, too.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:30.190
I'll go myself.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.190
We'll just leave a note.

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:33.370
O-Okay.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.430
Uh, it's pretty far...

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:39.850
Seriously?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.510
Sorry to put you through all this.

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:49.470
It's no big deal. There wasn't much choice.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:52.800
Tokyo is really amazing though, isn't it?

00:13:52.800 --> 00:13:55.310
The big train stations 
have all kinds of shops.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:56.550
Y-Yeah...

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.440
And there are so many people 
in stylish clothes.

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.070
I'm not really into fashion,

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:05.440
but when you live in the city, 
you gotta do the bare minimum to dress up.

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.200
There's no brand-name stuff out here.

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:10.240
Know any good stores?

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:12.160
Huh? Um...

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:18.570
"Went to get the amusement park?"

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:29.090
I-It sure is hot.

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:31.890
Yeah. Want to take a break somewhere?

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.060
There! It says you can drink the water!

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:37.980
Oh, you're right.

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:41.730
The water's coming from a 
spring through the pipe!

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:49.080
It's cool and yummy!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.040
This water tastes great!

00:14:58.400 --> 00:15:00.990
I'm glad there was water 
just when we needed it.

00:15:00.990 --> 00:15:02.000
Let me.

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.360
I feel alive again!

00:15:06.360 --> 00:15:09.760
There's not a shadow of city folk 
in you right now, Hika-nee.

00:15:10.030 --> 00:15:13.260
Shut up! Appearances mean 
nothing in the city!

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.430
That's not what she said earlier.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:20.310
What do you wanna do? Take a break here?

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:22.690
Yes, let's do that.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:25.690
Pomegranates
1 for 100 yen

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.370
Hika-nee! There are pomegranates over here!

00:15:25.990 --> 00:15:28.440
Huh, they sell these here?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.450
Maybe I'll buy one.

00:15:35.640 --> 00:15:37.290
So this is a pomegranate...

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.790
Thank you for buying it.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.500
No problem. I got an 
allowance from Nee-chan.

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:46.460
I had heard the name before, 
but I'd never seen one.

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:49.670
Well, I guess they don't have 
many of those in Tokyo.

00:15:49.670 --> 00:15:52.510
This is good! Try yours, too, Hotarun!

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.230
O-Okay.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:02.690
It's both sweet and sour. I like it!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.930
See?

00:16:03.930 --> 00:16:04.800
Yeah!

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.190
What a big dragonfly!

00:16:11.550 --> 00:16:12.860
A jumbo dragonfly!

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.410
Huh?! Where? Where?

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.590
Hika-nee, up there!

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:17.490
Whoa, it's huge!

00:16:17.800 --> 00:16:19.000
Let's chase it!

00:16:19.000 --> 00:16:19.860
Huh?!

00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.520
Jumbo! Wait for me!

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.420
All right! Get it, Renge!

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.000
Wait!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.130
Over there! Over there! Run!

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.640
Hey! Jumbo!

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:32.160
Wait!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:36.050
Jumbo! Wait!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.590
Run!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:37.490
Run, Renge!

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.520
To the right, to the right! The right! Yeah!

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:41.320
Almost there! Just a little 
further and I can catch it!

00:16:42.610 --> 00:16:45.110
Renge! Ah, darn!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.110
Jumbo!

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:02.410
We made it all the way to the bus 
depot before I even noticed.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:03.360
Yeah.

00:17:03.360 --> 00:17:05.960
We couldn't catch the jumbo dragonfly.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.670
Excuse me!

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:11.130
Safety Bulletin Board

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:11.130
Oh, right, right.

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:15.630
The items forgotten on the bus 
that just came in are over there.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.100
Forgotten Items

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.100
Oh! That's my bag!

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:20.940
I'm glad we found your bag.

00:17:20.940 --> 00:17:21.840
Yeah!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.520
Oh, I'll show you the picture.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.980
Wow! An amusement park!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:29.490
Are these your friends from your old school?

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:30.220
Yep.

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:32.190
Are they younger students?

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.940
Oh, they're in my grade.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:34.900
What?!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:44.160
We picked lots of raspberries.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.150
That tree produces tons of 
raspberries every year.

00:17:47.150 --> 00:17:49.060
Wow, really?

00:17:49.060 --> 00:17:50.690
They're really good. Try some.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:51.750
Okay!

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.860
So did you write her back?

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.140
No, not yet.

00:18:02.800 --> 00:18:05.970
I'd like to send her some kind of picture, too,

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:08.180
but I'm not sure what it should be.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:12.790
Feels great!

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.920
Nattsun dove in again.

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:16.070
Renge, Renge!

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:17.400
Here!

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.200
I'm gonna dive in, too.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.430
Take a picture of me when I do, okay?

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:23.280
I wanna show it off in Tokyo.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.330
Ooh! I can take a picture?

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.410
Push the button in the middle 
to take the picture,

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:29.380
and the button on the right to check it.

00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:31.000
Roger!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:37.420
Okay, Natsumi! I'm gonna dive, too!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.550
Yeah! Come on, dive in!

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.210
All right! Here I come!

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.600
Come on in!

00:18:45.630 --> 00:18:46.390
There!

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:53.150
Renge! Did you get a good shot 
of my moment of bravery?

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:02.880
Well, I did get a shot.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:05.290
All right! That's my Renge!

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:10.870
What's wrong, Hotaru?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:13.210
I was thinking...

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:16.840
...of trying that dive again.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.340
Are you sure? You don't have 
to if you don't want to.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.550
N-No, it's not that I don't want to.

00:19:26.130 --> 00:19:29.690
Hey, why don't you get a picture of you 
diving in, and send that to your friends?

00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:32.830
But... Could I do that?

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:36.440
Hika-nee! Can we take a picture 
with your cell phone?

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:40.340
Hotaru wants to send her friends 
a picture of her diving in.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.360
Okay! I'll print it and send it to you.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:44.930
Th-Thank you!

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:46.330
S'okay.

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:49.830
Hotaru!

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.500
Hotaru, let's play!

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.660
Meowning!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:55.580
We're going to the secret base again.

00:21:59.030 --> 00:22:00.470
Okay!

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:16.460
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:21.550
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:41.010 --> 00:23:43.390
<i>Curry! Curry! Curry!</i>

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:44.860
<i>Nummy, nummy!</i>

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:46.470
<i>Shokichi-san!</i>

00:23:46.470 --> 00:23:48.610
<i>My all-time record!</i>

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:50.490
<i>Nummy, nummy!</i>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:53.490
<b>I Took Lunch Duty</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
<b>Non Non Biyori
Repeat</b>

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
Photo: Organic Mandarin

00:23:53.490 --> 00:23:55.990
